* MB10S, 1000 V 0.5 A bridge (onsemi MB10S rev. 3): 4 diodes fitted to the datasheet's
* VF <= 1.0 V at 0.5 A per diode, 1000 V. Pins as KiCad's MB6S symbol: AC1, AC2, +, -.
* onsemi publishes no model (library/sources.csv). sim/mb10s_model.cir holds it to the datasheet.
.subckt MB10S AC1 AC2 P N
D1 AC1 P DBR
D2 AC2 P DBR
D3 N AC1 DBR
D4 N AC2 DBR
.model DBR D(IS=1e-9 N=1.8 RS=0.1 BV=1000 IBV=5u CJO=15p TT=2u)
.ends MB10S
